vUHHddYM6EQ3IcHCJcBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["熊越岳這間店經過很多次了，每次看到門口都排著長長的人龍，我就瞬間失去耐心，所以這麼多年來一直沒有機會吃到🤣\n\n印象中以前好像只是路邊的小麵攤，沒想到現在已經進駐百貨公司 B1，人氣依然很高。\n\n這次平日下午來用餐，人潮比想像中少一些，排隊後有座位可以坐著等，大約十幾分鐘就輪到了。\n\n我點的是醬油豚骨濃湯拉麵（背脂），湯頭濃郁香氣十足，不過對我來說稍微偏重口味一點😆 麵量也不少，吃完整碗其實蠻有飽足感，最後湯沒有喝完。\n\n店員服務態度很好，也有提供紙圍兜避免湯汁噴濺到衣服，算是蠻貼心的小細節。\n\n總算解鎖了一間經過很多年卻一直沒吃過的店，如果喜歡濃厚系拉麵，可以來試試看。",null,[0,95]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPZUZVd01WVlRlbFpQWTBjeE5GRjZRazFoVlZwMFdESmFUR1ZXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4308,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OeFUwMVVTelZPY0cxNFF6Qk1hVVp0WDJaTGVWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x10c98e45c03aec63!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnNxU01USzVOcG14QzBMaUZtX2ZLeVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OeFUwMVVTelZPY0cxNFF6Qk1hVVp0WDJaTGVWRRAB\u002